          ‘accidental-switch-interface’ to the value of the context’s
          ‘alterationGlyphs’ property, when defined.

          Properties (read)

               ‘alterationGlyphs’ (list)
                    Alist mapping alterations to accidental glyphs.
                    Alterations are given as exact numbers, e.g., -1/2
                    for flat.  This applies to all grobs that can print
                    accidentals.

     *note Apply_output_engraver::
