     *note Tie_engraver::
          Generate ties between note heads of equal pitch.

          Music types accepted: *note tie-event::

          Properties (read)

               ‘skipTypesetting’ (boolean)
                    If true, no typesetting is done, speeding up the
                    interpretation phase.  Useful for debugging large
