          TupletBracket:: and *note TupletNumber::.


File: lilypond-internals.info,  Node: InternalGregorianStaff,  Next: InternalMensuralStaff,  Prev: GregorianTranscriptionVoice,  Up: Contexts

2.1.17 ‘InternalGregorianStaff’
-------------------------------

A kind of ‘Staff’ with settings shared by multiple variants of Gregorian
chant notation.

   This context creates the following layout object(s): *note
Accidental::, *note AccidentalCautionary::, *note AccidentalPlacement::,
*note AccidentalSuggestion::, *note BarLine::, *note BassFigure::, *note
