          This engraver creates the following layout object(s): *note
          OttavaBracket::.

     *note Piano_pedal_align_engraver::
          Align piano pedal symbols and brackets.

          Properties (read)

               ‘currentCommandColumn’ (graphical (layout) object)
                    Grob that is X-parent to all current breakable items
